[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SECOND_FLEET]
Sire’s Hollow Second Fleet

[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SECOND_FLEET_desc]
“A powerful Navy we have always regarded as our proper and natural means of defense; and it has always been of defense that we have thought, never of aggression or of conquest.”

[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SECOND_FLEET_TOOLTIP]
Assemble the Sire’s Hollow Second Fleet in the southern harbour of §Y[531.GetName]§!.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SECOND_FLEET]
名流谷第二舰队

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SECOND_FLEET_desc]
“一支强大的海军一直被我们视为我们适当和自然的防御手段；我们一直认为它是防御，而不是侵略或征服。”

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SECOND_FLEET_TOOLTIP]
在§Y[531.GetName]§!的南部港湾组建名流谷第二舰队。

